control: A policy write records only a declared identity
removes: the declared identity header is never read, so a write without it is recorded under the operator name
packages: ./ui/internal/api
tests: TestAPolicyWriteRecordsTheDeclaredIdentity
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

diff --git a/ui/internal/api/identity.go b/ui/internal/api/identity.go
index 4e9887ff..d55ae750 100644
